# Auth

###  登录
POST {{url}}/auth/login
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "Soybean",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 刷新token
POST {{url}}/auth/refreshToken
Content-Type: application/json
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}


### 获取用户信息
GET {{url}}/auth/getUserInfo
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
Authorization:{{token}}


### 自定义后端错误
GET {{url}}/auth/error?code=6667&msg=自定义后端错误
Content-Type: application/json
apifoxToken: {{apiKey}}
